export anchor Settings:
    description:
        The account and workspace settings page, on the Notifications tab.

    tabs:
        - Profile
        - Notifications, the current tab
        - Workspace
        - Billing
        - Security

    notifications:
        - Email me when a task is assigned to me, on
        - Email me when a task I follow is completed, off
        - Daily summary at 08:00, on
        - Weekly report on Monday, on
        - Mentions in comments, push and email
        - Quiet hours from 19:00 to 07:00, on

    fields:
        Time zone set to Europe/Berlin, summary language set to English, and a
        digest frequency choice of Daily, Weekly or Never with Daily selected.

    actions:
        Save changes and Cancel buttons, a "Changes saved" confirmation
        example, and a Danger zone box with Leave workspace.
